  "form_descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "Les formes ont différentes stats et talents. Démétéros change de forme quand le Miroir Sacré est utilisé sur lui.\n\nLe Miroir Sacré peut être obtenu en emmenant un Démétéros Avatar au Autel Abondance. (Démétéros peut être obtenu sous la Forme Totémique dans le RAdar Pokémon.)",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Forms have different stats and abilities.  Landorus switches forms when the Reveal Glass is used on it.\n\nThe Reveal Glass may be obtained by taking a Therian Landorus to Abundant Shrine.  (Landorus can be obtained in Therian Forme from the Dream Radar.)",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait fructifier les cultures partout\noù il passe, c’est pourquoi on l’appelle\n“le dieu des moissons”.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lands visited by Landorus grant such\nbountiful crops that it has been hailed\nas “The Guardian of the Fields.”",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’énergie déversée par sa queue\nenrichit les sols en nutriments et\nfavorise les cultures.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The energy that comes pouring from its\ntail increases the nutrition in the soil,\nmaking crops grow to great size.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "From the forces of lightning and wind,\nit creates energy to give nutrients to\nthe soil and make the land abundant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "From the forces of lightning and wind,\nit creates energy to give nutrients to\nthe soil and make the land abundant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ランドロスの　おとずれる　とちは\nさくもつが　たくさん　みのるため\nはたけのかみさま　と　いわれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "랜드로스가 찾아온 땅에는\n작물에 열매가 많이 열리기 때문에\n농지의 신이라고 전해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il fait fructifier les cultures partout où il passe, c’est\npourquoi on l’appelle « le dieu des moissons ».",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da an Orten, wo es sich blicken lässt, mit reicher\nErnte zu rechnen ist, nennt man es auch den\n„Herrn des Ackerbaus“.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lo consideran una deidad de las cosechas porque los\ncultivos crecen en abundancia en las tierras por las\nque pasa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Poiché le terre che visita producono abbondanti\nraccolti, è considerato una benedizione per i campi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lands visited by Landorus grant such bountiful\ncrops that it has been hailed as “The Guardian of\nthe Fields.”",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ランドロスが　訪れる　土地は\n作物が　たくさん　実るため\n畑の神様　と　言われている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lo consideran una deidad de las cosechas porque los\ncultivos crecen en abundancia en las tierras por las\nque pasa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かぜや　かみなりを　とりこみ　かえた\nエネルギーが　つちに　えいようを\nあたえて　だいちを　ゆたかに　する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "바람이나 번개를 거둬들여 바꾼\n에너지가 흙에 영양을\n주어 대지를 풍족하게 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il utilise l’énergie qu’il tire du vent et de la foudre\npour enrichir les sols en nutriments pour les cultures.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seine aus Wind und Donner gewonnene Energie\nsorgt für reiche Ernten, da sie den Boden mit\nNährstoffen anreichert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Utiliza energía que obtiene del viento y del relámpago\npara nutrir el suelo y generar abundantes cosechas.",
